{"title": "Arcane Ward (Condition)", "pageid": 19859, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arcane_Ward_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has stack type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Ward Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Arcane_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Arcane Ward</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Your Arcane Ward blocks damage equal to its charges and then loses 1 charge. Casting <a href=\"/wiki/Abjuration_spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Abjuration spells\">Abjuration spells</a> will add charges equal to the level of the spell. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Ic